    "title": "Guard Watch Face",
    "description": "The Wear OS watch face with dual display offers two separate sections, showing different types of information simultaneously, such as time in one section and other relevant data in the other. The additional information menu allow the user to access more detailed information about various aspects like weather, providing a comprehensive and customizable user experience on the watch. \r\n\r\n\u2605 DISCLAIMER \u2605\r\nThe free version doesn't have a tap functionality. It just shows data and the user is not able to change anything until unlock the paid version.\r\nThe phone battery indicator works only if you connect the smartwatch to Android phone device and install companion app. It is not required feature and the app will work normally without the companion app.\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2003<b>FAQ</b>\r\n!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! \r\nrichface.watch@gmail.com\r\n\r\n\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained\r\nhttps://www.richface.watch/privacy",
